    "Review existing boards to identify design weaknesses and opportunities to improve routing, component selection, reliability, and manufacturing cost while preserving required functionality.": "审查现有电路板，找出设计弱点，并在保留所需功能的前提下，改进布线、元器件选型、可靠性和制造成本。",
    "Rizviz and its team of professionals follow one clear roadmap, from the first conversation to long-term support. We plan, build, test, and launch alongside you, so every delivery is seamless and dependable.": "Rizviz 及其专业团队遵循一条清晰的路线，从最初的沟通到长期支持。我们与您并肩规划、构建、测试和上线，确保每一次交付都顺畅可靠。",
    "Rizviz brings development and operations together through automation and carefully configured infrastructure. We help simplify software delivery, reduce repetitive maintenance, and create consistent environments for your applications. Our team works with you to understand your existing setup and build processes that support everyday operations and future growth.": "Rizviz 通过自动化和精心配置的基础设施，让开发与运维紧密协同。我们帮助简化软件交付、减少重复性维护，并为您的应用打造一致的环境。我们的团队与您一起了解现有架构，构建支持日常运营和未来增长的流程。",
    "Rizviz brings together expertise in software, AI, data, and cloud technologies to build practical digital solutions. We work closely with your team to understand your operations and develop systems that support the way you work. Our engineers, developers, and technology specialists collaborate across disciplines to bring each solution to life.": "Rizviz 汇聚软件、人工智能、数据和云技术方面的专业能力，打造切实可行的数字化解决方案。我们与您的团队紧密合作，了解您的业务运作，开发契合您工作方式的系统。我们的工程师、开发人员和技术专家跨领域协作，将每一个解决方案变为现实。",
    "Rizviz builds the data pipelines and systems that bring your business information together. We help collect, organize, and prepare data from different sources so it is ready for reporting, analytics, and AI. Our team works around your existing systems to make data easier to access, maintain, and use.": "Rizviz 构建汇聚业务信息的数据管道和系统。我们帮助收集、整理并准备来自不同来源的数据，使其可直接用于报表、分析和 AI。我们的团队围绕您现有的系统开展工作，让数据更易获取、维护和使用。",
    "Rizviz designs, analyzes, and optimizes printed circuit boards for your products. We work with you from the first schematic through layout, simulation, and prototype validation, so your board performs as intended and is ready to hand over for manufacturing.": "Rizviz 为您的产品设计、分析和优化印刷电路板。从第一张原理图，到布局、仿真和原型验证，我们与您全程协作，确保电路板按预期运行，并随时可以移交生产制造。",
    "Rizviz designs, analyzes, and optimizes printed circuit boards, supporting your product from initial schematics through prototype validation and manufacturing handover.": "Rizviz 负责印刷电路板的设计、分析和优化，从最初的原理图到原型验证，再到移交生产制造，全程支持您的产品。",
    "Rizviz develops AI-powered applications around the way your business operates. From simplifying repetitive tasks to helping people find and interpret information, we connect AI capabilities with practical needs. Our team works with you to identify where AI can add value and build solutions that fit your existing workflows.": "Rizviz 围绕您的业务运作方式开发 AI 应用。从简化重复性任务到帮助人们查找和理解信息，我们把 AI 能力与实际需求紧密结合。我们的团队与您一起找出 AI 能创造价值的环节，并构建契合现有工作流程的解决方案。",
    "Rizviz develops mobile applications that connect your services with the people who use them. From customer-facing products to tools for your team, we focus on clear interfaces and practical functionality. Our developers work with you to shape the experience, connect supporting systems, and prepare your application for everyday use.": "Rizviz 开发连接您的服务与用户的移动应用。从面向客户的产品到团队使用的工具，我们专注于清晰的界面和实用的功能。我们的开发人员与您一起塑造使用体验、对接支撑系统，并让应用为日常使用做好准备。",
    "Rizviz develops software around your business processes, users, and operational needs. From internal tools to complete enterprise systems, we turn requirements into practical applications. Our team brings together planning, development, and testing to build software that supports everyday work and can evolve as your business changes.": "Rizviz 围绕您的业务流程、用户和运营需求开发软件。从内部工具到完整的企业系统，我们把需求变成实用的应用。团队将规划、开发和测试融为一体，构建既能支撑日常工作、又能随业务变化而演进的软件。",
    "Rizviz develops websites that bring your brand, services, and digital experiences together. From business websites to interactive web applications, we focus on clear navigation, responsive layouts, and practical functionality. Our team works with you to create an online presence that serves your visitors and remains easy to manage as your business grows.": "Rizviz 开发整合您品牌、服务和数字体验的网站。从企业官网到交互式网页应用，我们注重清晰的导航、响应式布局和实用的功能。团队与您一起打造服务访客、并能随业务增长而易于管理的线上形象。",
    "Rizviz helps businesses configure and adapt ServiceNow around the way their teams work. We bring requests, approvals, and service processes into connected workflows, reducing manual coordination and improving visibility. Our team works with you to understand existing processes and develop a platform experience that supports your operational needs.": "Rizviz 帮助企业按照团队的工作方式配置和调整 ServiceNow。我们把请求、审批和服务流程整合进互联的工作流，减少人工协调并提升透明度。我们的团队与您一起了解现有流程，打造支持运营需求的平台体验。",
    "Rizviz is a technology company developing software, intelligent applications, and enterprise solutions around real business needs. Our expertise spans AI, data, cloud infrastructure, and application development, allowing us to connect different parts of a business through technology.": "Rizviz 是一家科技公司，围绕真实业务需求开发软件、智能应用和企业解决方案。我们的专长涵盖 AI、数据、云基础设施和应用开发，使我们能够借助技术连接企业的各个环节。",
    "Rizviz offers full support and cooperation throughout your hiring period, with clear communication and guidance from your application to your first day.": "在整个招聘期间，Rizviz 将为您提供全面的支持与配合，从投递申请到入职第一天，始终保持清晰的沟通和指引。",
    "Rizviz supports electronic product development through schematic design, PCB layout, engineering analysis, and prototype testing support. We translate your electrical, mechanical, and operational requirements into designs that balance performance, reliability, and manufacturability.": "Rizviz 通过原理图设计、PCB 布局、工程分析和原型测试支持，为电子产品开发提供助力。我们把您的电气、机械和运行要求转化为兼顾性能、可靠性和可制造性的设计。",
    "Rizviz supports your growth with structured business development: finding the right opportunities, building relationships with the right partners, and turning conversations into lasting engagements. Our team works with you to understand your market, shape your offering, and put a practical plan in place to reach new customers.": "Rizviz 通过系统化的业务拓展支持您的增长：发现合适的机会，与合适的伙伴建立关系，并把沟通转化为长期合作。我们的团队与您一起了解市场、打磨产品与服务，并制定切实可行的计划去触达新客户。",
    "Rizviz works with organizations in": "Rizviz 与位于",
